# فاز ۹: Logging, Monitoring and Automation

## هدف
رفتار سیستم را ببینی و Health Check خودکار داشته باشی.

## 9.1 بررسی لاگ‌ها
```bash
sudo tail -f /var/log/auth.log
sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/sec-lab-access.log
sudo tail -f /var/log/nginx/sec-lab-error.log
```

اگر `auth.log` وجود نداشت:
```bash
sudo journalctl -u ssh -f
```

## 9.2 ساخت اسکریپت Health Check
```bash
sudo vim /usr/local/bin/system_health_check.sh
```

محتوا:
```bash
#!/bin/bash

LOG_FILE="/var/log/system_health_check.log"
TIMESTAMP="$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')"

{
    echo "===== Health Check: $TIMESTAMP ====="
    echo

    echo "[Disk Usage]"
    df -h
    echo

    echo "[Service Status: ssh]"
    systemctl is-active ssh
    echo

    echo "[Service Status: nginx]"
    systemctl is-active nginx
    echo

    echo "[Service Status: fail2ban]"
    systemctl is-active fail2ban
    echo

    echo "[Last 5 Failed SSH Attempts]"
    if [ -f /var/log/auth.log ]; then
        grep "Failed password" /var/log/auth.log | tail -n 5
    else
        journalctl -u ssh --no-pager | grep "Failed password" | tail -n 5
    fi
    echo
} >> "$LOG_FILE"
```

## 9.3 دادن Permission اجرا
```bash
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/system_health_check.sh
```

## 9.4 تست دستی
```bash
sudo /usr/local/bin/system_health_check.sh
sudo tail -n 50 /var/log/system_health_check.log
```

