# فاز ۱۰: Backup, Verification, Troubleshooting and Documentation

## 10.1 ساخت اسکریپت Backup
```bash
sudo vim /usr/local/bin/system_backup.sh
```

محتوا:
```bash
#!/bin/bash

BACKUP_DIR="/backups"
TIMESTAMP="$(date '+%Y-%m-%d_%H-%M-%S')"
BACKUP_FILE="$BACKUP_DIR/config_backup_$TIMESTAMP.tar.gz"

mkdir -p "$BACKUP_DIR"

tar -czf "$BACKUP_FILE" \
    /etc/ssh \
    /etc/nginx \
    /var/www/sec-lab

find "$BACKUP_DIR" -type f -name "config_backup_*.tar.gz" -mtime +7 -delete
```

## 10.2 Permission اجرا
```bash
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/system_backup.sh
```

## 10.3 تست دستی Backup
```bash
sudo /usr/local/bin/system_backup.sh
ls -lh /backups
tar -tzf /backups/$(ls /backups | tail -n 1) | head
```

## 10.4 تنظیم Cron
```bash
sudo crontab -e
```

این‌ها را اضافه کن:
```cron
*/15 * * * * /usr/local/bin/system_health_check.sh
0 2 * * * /usr/local/bin/system_backup.sh
```

## 10.5 بررسی Cron
```bash
sudo crontab -l
sudo systemctl status cron
```

